msgid "None"
msgstr "Nijedan"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Opće postavke"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service Check Name"
msgstr "Naziv provjere servisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The name that is displayed for this Service Check, and is included in any Alert notifications."
msgstr "Naziv koji se prikazuje za ovu provjeru servisa i koji je uključen u sva obavještenja o upozorenjima."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many attempts"
msgstr "Koliko pokušaja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti attempts to run each test multiple times. The first successful attempt ends the testing and records the success. If none of the attempts are successful, the test is terminated and a failure is recorded. High number causes log test duration."
msgstr "Cacti pokušava pokrenuti svaki test više puta. Prvi uspješan pokušaj završava testiranje i bilježi uspjeh. Ako nijedan pokušaj nije uspješan, test se prekida i bilježi se neuspjeh. Veliki broj uzrokuje dugo trajanje testa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable test"
msgstr "Omogući test"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disable this test from being checked."
msgstr "Odznačite ovo polje da onemogućite provjeru ovog testa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable run script for this test"
msgstr "Omogući pokretanje skripte za ovaj test"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the global Command Execution function is enabled, you can set here whether the script should be run for this test or not."
msgstr "Ako je omogućena globalna funkcija izvršavanja naredbi, ovdje možete podesiti da li skripta treba biti pokrenuta za ovaj test ili ne."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Poller"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller on which the test will run"
msgstr "Poller na kojem će se test pokretati"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Type of service"
msgstr "Tip servisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "What type of service?"
msgstr "Koji tip servisa?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "IP Address or DNS name of server"
msgstr "IP adresa ili DNS naziv servera"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You can specify another port (example.com:5000) otherwise default will be used. For IPv6 numeric address use [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use here name of server (example 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"
msgstr "Možete navesti drugi port (example.com:5000), u suprotnom će se koristiti podrazumijevani. Za numeričku IPv6 adresu koristite [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. Za DOH (DNS over HTTPS) ovdje koristite naziv servera (primjer 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Resolve DNS to Address"
msgstr "Razriješi DNS u adresu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an IP Address to force DNS name to resolve to. Leaving blank will use DNS Resolution instead."
msgstr "Unesite IP adresu na koju želite prisilno razriješiti DNS naziv. Ako ostavite prazno, koristit će se DNS razrješavanje."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "Postavke servisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Select correct credential"
msgstr "Odaberite ispravan akreditiv"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP OID"
msgstr "SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SNMP OID"
msgstr "Unesite SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH command"
msgstr "SSH naredba"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SSH command with full path, result of command will be returned"
msgstr "Unesite SSH naredbu sa punom putanjom, rezultat naredbe će biti vraćen"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your own CA and intermediate certs"
msgstr "Vaši vlastiti CA i posrednički certifikati"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP Search"
msgstr "LDAP pretraga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search filter, it could be ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"
msgstr "LDAP filter pretrage, može biti ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS Name for Query"
msgstr "DNS naziv za upit"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS name for querying. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use /resolve?name=example.com or /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. For plaintext DNS A and AAAA records will be returned"
msgstr "DNS naziv za slanje upita. Za DOH (DNS over HTTPS) koristite /resolve?name=example.com ili /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. Za nešifrovani DNS bit će vraćeni A i AAAA zapisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Path Part of URL"
msgstr "Dio putanje URL-a"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For web service insert at least \"/\" or something like \"/any/path/\"."
msgstr "Za web servis unesite barem \"/\" ili nešto poput \"/neka/putanja/\"."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Zahtijeva autentifikaciju"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Označite ovo polje ako stranica obično vraća grešku 401 jer zahtijeva korisničko ime i lozinku."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Proxy server"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Ako ova konekcija zahtijeva proxy, odaberite ga ovdje. U suprotnom odaberite 'Ništa'."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Provjeri certifikat"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Ako koristite SSL, označite ovo polje ako želite provjeriti valjanost certifikata. Podrazumijevano uključeno, isključite ako stranica koristi samopotpisani certifikat."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check and notify Certificate expiration"
msgstr "Provjeri i obavijesti o isteku certifikata"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to check the certificate expiration. You can set in settings how many days before expiration notify.."
msgstr "Ako koristite SSL, označite ovo polje ako želite provjeravati istek certifikata. U postavkama možete podesiti koliko dana prije isteka poslati obavještenje.."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametri"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How Often to Test"
msgstr "Koliko često testirati"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Test every xth poller run"
msgstr "Testiraj svako x-to pokretanje pollera"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Okidač"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the service must be DOWN before an alert email is triggered."
msgstr "Koliko puta servis mora biti nedostupan (DOWN) prije nego što se pokrene e-mail upozorenje."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Long duration alert"
msgstr "Upozorenje za dugo trajanje"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the test time is greater than this value more times in a row, send a notification. Related to variable Duration count. The test inherits the maximum runtime from the settings. If a higher value is set here, the maximum runtime is this value + 2 seconds."
msgstr "Ako je vrijeme testa veće od ove vrijednosti više puta zaredom, pošalji obavještenje. Povezano sa varijablom Broj trajanja. Test nasljeđuje maksimalno vrijeme izvršavanja iz postavki. Ako je ovdje postavljena veća vrijednost, maksimalno vrijeme izvršavanja je ova vrijednost + 2 sekunde."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Number of duration violations in a row"
msgstr "Broj prekoračenja trajanja zaredom"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the duration trigger must be exceeded in a row for a notification to be sent"
msgstr "Koliko puta zaredom prag trajanja mora biti prekoračen da bi se poslalo obavještenje"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verification Strings"
msgstr "Stringovi za provjeru"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String"
msgstr "String za pretragu u odgovoru"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for in the response for a live and working service."
msgstr "Ovo je string koji se traži u odgovoru za aktivan i ispravan servis."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Maintenance"
msgstr "String za pretragu u odgovoru - Održavanje"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for on the Maintenance .  The Service Check will check for this string if the above string is not found.  If found, it means that the service is under maintenance."
msgstr "Ovo je string koji se traži za održavanje. Provjera servisa će tražiti ovaj string ako gornji string nije pronađen. Ako se pronađe, to znači da je servis u fazi održavanja."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Failed"
msgstr "String za pretragu u odgovoru - Neuspješno"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for a known failure in the service response.  The Service Check will only alert if this string is found, ignoring any timeout issues and the search strings above."
msgstr "Ovo je string koji se traži za poznati neuspjeh u odgovoru servisa. Provjera servisa će poslati upozorenje samo ako se ovaj string pronađe, ignorišući sve probleme sa istekom vremena i gore navedene stringove za pretragu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notification Settings"
msgstr "Postavke obavještenja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Email notification"
msgstr "E-mail obavještenje"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If enabled email notification about state, duration and search result will be send"
msgstr "Ako je omogućeno, bit će poslano e-mail obavještenje o stanju, trajanju i rezultatu pretrage"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notify Format"
msgstr "Format obavještenja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the format to use when sending the notification email"
msgstr "Ovo je format koji se koristi prilikom slanja e-maila sa obavještenjem"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notification List"
msgstr "Lista obavještenja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use this Notification List for those to be notified when this service goes down."
msgstr "Koristite ovu listu obavještenja za one koji trebaju biti obaviješteni kada ovaj servis prestane s radom."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notify Accounts"
msgstr "Nalozi za obavještavanje"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is a listing of accounts that will be notified when this service goes down."
msgstr "Ovo je spisak naloga koji će biti obaviješteni kada ovaj servis prestane s radom."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Extra Alert Emails"
msgstr "Dodatne email adrese za upozorenja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You may specify here extra Emails to receive alerts for this test (comma separated)"
msgstr "Ovdje možete navesti dodatne email adrese za primanje upozorenja za ovaj test (odvojene zarezom)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Napomene"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notes sent in email"
msgstr "Bilješke poslane u emailu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "External ID"
msgstr "Eksterni ID"

#: includes/arrays.php
